      "text": {
        "jp": "……ミトラの町にか？\r\nだけど、今は城に急がないと……。",
        "official_en": "You want to go to Mitra? At a time like this? We need to get to the castle as soon as possible.",
        "real_en": "You mean Mitra...? But we need to hurry back to the castle..."
