      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "くそ……。\r\nあいつを倒していれば、みんなが死ぬことはなかった……。",
        "official_en": "Damn it... If I was stronger, they would all still be alive...",
        "real_en": "Damn it... If I’d defeated him, none of them would have died..."
