        "official_en_sha256": "5e95799f9b79b78414601a176c4e3364861b3e76e9fe56aa7008273a8eabff07"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "だったら、俺は先に城に行っている。\r\nラスウェルはあとからきてくれ。",
        "official_en": "If that’s the case, we’ll split here. I’ll head to the castle. You follow along after.",
        "real_en": "Then I’ll head to the castle first. You can follow later, Lasswell."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
