      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "レイン。\r\n城に行く前に、俺たちの故郷に寄る。",
        "official_en": "Rain. Before we return to the castle though, we should stop at our hometown on our way.",
        "real_en": "Rain. Before we return to the castle, we’re stopping in our hometown."
